{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"padEffectiveCropScale"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The heads crop with the handoff’s own "},{"code":"_get_new_box","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which clamps the requested scale so the padded box fits the frame. A"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"face close enough to fill the frame drives that clamp down toward 1,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"handing a 4.0x model something nearer a bare bounding box. The handoff"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is explicit that the scale is load-bearing and not interchangeable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"between models, and that feeding the wrong one does not fail loudly —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it silently degrades, which reads as the model being wrong rather than"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the frame being outside it."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR","doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/ObservedSignalRates"]]},"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/yeofr\/observedsignalrates\/padeffectivecropscale"]}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.yeomessaging.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/ObservedSignalRates\/padEffectiveCropScale","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"r